## How it works
1. Once user submits request via registration form in the portal, a record gets created in the 'Trainer Registrations' table.
2. This flow gets triggered and checks if the training selected has a competency head.
3. An email gets triggered to the competency head requesting approval or rejection.
4. If approved, an email is triggered to the user and status of the registration gets updated to 'approved'.
5. If rejected, an email will still be triggered to the user and the status of the registration gets updated to 'rejected'.
